1
00:00:00,155 --> 00:00:02,093
Lebahnya sudah pergi...

2
00:00:02,093 --> 00:00:04,622
tapi sengatnya masih menyerangmu.

3
00:00:04,622 --> 00:00:06,386
Sengat lebah madu bergerigi,

4
00:00:06,386 --> 00:00:07,762
jadi tersangkut di kulit.

5
00:00:07,762 --> 00:00:09,147
Saat lebah kabur,

6
00:00:09,147 --> 00:00:11,531
sengatnya tercabut bersama kantong racun.

7
00:00:11,531 --> 00:00:13,091
Lebahnya pun mati.

8
00:00:13,091 --> 00:00:14,961
Kamera super cepat merekam:

9
00:00:14,961 --> 00:00:17,287
sengat itu terus memompa racun sendiri,

10
00:00:17,287 --> 00:00:18,837
seperti mesin 2 piston.

11
00:00:18,837 --> 00:00:20,601
Bisa sampai 1 menit!

12
00:00:20,601 --> 00:00:21,609
Saat menyengat,

13
00:00:21,609 --> 00:00:24,205
lebah juga menebar bau mirip pisang...

14
00:00:24,205 --> 00:00:25,436
memanggil lebah lain.

15
00:00:25,436 --> 00:00:26,134
Jadi,

16
00:00:26,134 --> 00:00:27,171
kerok pakai kuku,

17
00:00:27,171 --> 00:00:28,043
secepatnya.

18
00:00:28,043 --> 00:00:29,977
Kamu pernah disengat lebah?
